	(text "Shack interface board, rev A (2026-10-02). Sheets: link, power, MCU and expander, SAFE latch, radio ports R1 to R3.\nR1 = FT-710: band data to the expander, TX sense also keys the PTT loop (R1_TX). R2, R3: band pins not used (D-86).\nCHASSIS: shack earth lug, GDT centre electrodes, mini-DIN shields, USB-C shell (J14)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
